  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN Renewable Energy (Course 1) In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The course is designed to teach participants about the practical application of project management tools in a renewable energy context, including&#xa0;solar, wind, biofuel, geothermal or hydro projects, and to enhance decision making and risk management capabilities.
30 participants from Cambodia, Lao PDR, Myanmar, Viet Nam, Philippines, Indonesia and Timor-Leste&#xa0;will be&#xa0;upskilled.&#xa0; 
The course is&#xa0;being delivered in September 2024, at the University of Auckland.</narrative>
  </description>
